<Slide style={{
  width: '1280px',
  height: '720px',
  background: '#0A0F1E',
  padding: '40px 64px',
  flexDirection: 'column',
}}>
  <Text style={{
    fontSize: 34,
    fontWeight: 'bold',
    color: '#F8FAFC',
    marginBottom: 24,
    fontFamily: '"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif',
  }}>
    教师端 · 智能导入流水线
  </Text>
  <Box style={{
    flexDirection: 'row',
    gap: 32,
    flex: 1,
    alignItems: 'stretch',
  }}>
    <Box style={{
      width: 420,
      background: '#131C33',
      borderRadius: 20,
      padding: 32,
      flexDirection: 'column',
      justifyContent: 'center',
      alignItems: 'center',
      gap: 14,
      border: '1px solid rgba(37,99,235,0.2)',
    }}>
      {[
        { icon: 'file', label: '上传 PDF', desc: '题目 + 可选答案双文件' },
        { icon: 'eye', label: '视觉模型识别', desc: '题号、题干、选项、LaTeX 公式' },
        { icon: 'link', label: '答案按题号匹配', desc: '防错位、防越界、映射为选项文本' },
        { icon: 'tag', label: '自动知识点归类', desc: '命中知识点库，未命中留空待审' },
        { icon: 'check-circle', label: '审核发布', desc: '缺答案禁止发布，铁律兜底' },
      ].map((s, i) => (
        <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
          <Box style={{
            width: 240,
            height: 64,
            background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #1E3A8A 0%, #2563EB 100%)',
            borderRadius: 12,
            flexDirection: 'row',
            alignItems: 'center',
            gap: 14,
            padding: '0 20px',
          }}>
            <FAIcon name={s.icon} style={{ fill: '#F8FAFC', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
            <Box>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F8FAFC' }}>{s.label}</Text>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(248,250,252,0.75)' }}>{s.desc}</Text>
            </Box>
          </Box>
          {i < 4 && (
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#D4AF37', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>↓</Text>
          )}
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>
    <Box style={{
      flex: 1,
      flexDirection: 'column',
      justifyContent: 'center',
      gap: 20,
    }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#C7D0E0', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
        教师只需上传 PDF，系统即可完成从识别到归类的完整预处理，并在审核页给出明确的缺答案/缺解析提醒。
      </Text>
      {[
        { title: '视觉模型识别', desc: '自动提取题干、选项、公式与题号' },
        { title: '答案防错位', desc: '按题号匹配，越界字母自动清空' },
        { title: 'AI 解析生成', desc: '自动为每道题生成英文逐步解析' },
        { title: '发布铁律', desc: '缺答案题目禁止发布，保证练习质量' },
      ].map((c, i) => (
        <Box key={i} style={{
          background: '#131C33',
          borderRadius: 14,
          padding: 18,
          flexDirection: 'row',
          alignItems: 'center',
          gap: 12,
          borderLeft: '3px solid #D4AF37',
        }}>
          <FAIcon name='check-circle' style={{ fill: '#D4AF37', width: 22, height: 22 }} />
          <Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F8FAFC' }}>{c.title}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A89A3' }}>{c.desc}</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{
    flexDirection: 'row',
    justifyContent: 'space-between',
    marginTop: 24,
  }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A89A3' }}>金瑞升学 · 金鹰系统</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A89A3' }}>14 / 18</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
